That 2054.93 -> 119.64 is why the batched reader exists. The SURVIVING committed proof of the same property is goal-landing-facts.test.ts arm "answers MANY goals for the price of one — the reader shares its walks", which asserts 40 questions cost exactly the decision-pages ONE cost (drilled: `landed ??=` -> `landed =` gives `expected 40 to be 1`).

